Scope
-----

This license covers the hand-maintained learning data and everything
generated from it:

  js/data/            the Portuguese cards: verbs, nouns, numbers, glossary,
                      adjectives, adverbs, connecting words, pronominal verbs,
                      sentences (forms, glosses, pronunciations, examples)
  ingles/js/data/     the English-for-Brazilians cards
  noruegues/js/data/  the Norwegian-for-Brazilians cards
  verbs/              the generated per-verb pages

The JavaScript that carries the data (object literals, `window.DATA_*`
globals) is part of the content; the schema those files follow is not.

